{"title":"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Regular hexagon <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/2/8029902caf855d940e465d04ff40101d8850c3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDEF$\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" /> has vertices <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/1/551822bebea33d0480d4f6b001920af36d9fa465.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, respectively. What is its area?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/2/96219acbfb6dba734db3cdf3d0a9569ada91ec07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 20\\sqrt {3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 22\\sqrt {3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 25\\sqrt {3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 27\\sqrt {3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"484\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To find the area of the regular hexagon, we only need to calculate the side length.\na distance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/8/2384595d5caa7e51af9b93c30db5956cf3bfbd98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{7^2+1^2} = \\sqrt{50} = 5\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"186\" height=\"19\" /> apart.  Half of this distance is the length of the longer leg of the right triangles.  Therefore, the side length of the hexagon is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb86e01b72bccf062b3dbf0627f1a1fbb52f901b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\cdot2 = \\frac{5\\sqrt{6}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"161\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p><p>The apothem is thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/2/3e2d29128a3ff0f06963f681efbfddcec81e3adb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{5\\sqrt{6}}{3}\\cdot\\sqrt{3} = \\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"164\" height=\"43\" />, yielding an area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/b/3fbb144f8156dcd1858eaf2448282927fb6b17b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot10\\sqrt{6}\\cdot\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{2}=25\\sqrt{3} \\implies \\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"260\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution 2 has the exact same solution as Solution 1 denoted, but instead, we do not need to know the value of the apothem. We could just apply s, which is the side length in this problem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/c/e4c86b356474ffcc4f589910a7bb18843bfde52c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5\\sqrt{6}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"35\" height=\"41\" /> into the hexagon area formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/e/eee000716f26ddc00d5ddac7e9bf6e1d9a012ee3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3  (\\frac{5\\sqrt{6}}{3})^2 \\sqrt{3} }{2}=25\\sqrt{3} \\implies \\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"232\" height=\"46\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B\">2006 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a hre